  "steps": [
    "Grind the coriander, green chillies, garlic, ginger, cloves, pepper, cumin, turmeric and vinegar to a smooth green paste.",
    "Marinate the chicken with the paste, lemon juice and salt for at least 1 hour.",
    "Heat the oil in a wide pan and add the marinated chicken.",
    "Cook on medium heat for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the chicken starts to colour.",
    "Cover and cook 15 minutes on low heat, then uncover and cook until the coating is dry and clings to the chicken.",
    "Serve with lemon wedges, onion rings and pav or rice."
  ]
